.pio/

# Ad-hoc debugging artifacts from live testing sessions (serial captures,
# background process PID files, one-off MQTT test payloads). None of these
# are part of the project - they're regenerated by hand during debugging
# and safe to delete any time. Kept out of git so a fresh checkout used as
# a reference for a new device never carries a prior session's scratch files.
*.pid
*.err
bench-*.json
__pycache__/
*.pyc
